{"vid":"CIXXZcXezWI","source":"CIXXZcXezWI.en.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0.6,"txt":"We at length discussed if we should just sell."},{"t":3.1,"txt":"In fact, everyone we knew, every industry professional,"},{"t":6.4,"txt":"every contact we had, everyone said,"},{"t":8.5,"txt":"sell it. It's too big."},{"t":10.1,"txt":"You guys don't know anything about the space."},{"t":12,"txt":"It's very complicated space."},{"t":13.8,"txt":"You don't want this."},{"t":15,"txt":"Sell it."},{"t":15.6,"txt":"There's one fact in life that you cannot deny."},{"t":18,"txt":"We are all going to die."},{"t":19.6,"txt":"So we want families to build that heritage at all of our"},{"t":23,"txt":"cemeteries. And in order to do that,"},{"t":25.1,"txt":"we've got to remain relevant to the future generations."},{"t":29.2,"txt":"I'm Shayda Frost and I'm 39 years old."},{"t":31.6,"txt":"I'm Timothy Amoui and I'm 36 years old."},{"t":34.7,"txt":"And our cemetery business brings in over $6 million a"},{"t":37.8,"txt":"year."},{"t":50.5,"txt":"So that includes Lincoln Cemetery,"},{"t":52.1,"txt":"Monte Vista, Washington Memorial Gardens and Dawn"},{"t":55.1,"txt":"Memorial Park."},{"t":57,"txt":"I have a really big view that cemeteries are for the"},{"t":59.6,"txt":"living. You don't know the difference of where your"},{"t":62.3,"txt":"body is or not, but your family and your"},{"t":64.6,"txt":"loved ones, they're the ones visiting the cemetery."},{"t":66.6,"txt":"They're the ones coming back year after year on"},{"t":68.7,"txt":"anniversaries, birthdays, holidays. Growing up in the"},{"t":77.4,"txt":"cemetery business, it's not as odd as you'd"},{"t":80.3,"txt":"think it would be. Oftentimes I have like old"},{"t":82.5,"txt":"friends being like, oh my God, I didn't know"},{"t":84,"txt":"your family was even in cemetery. And I was like,"},{"t":85.9,"txt":"oh, because for me, it was so normalized."},{"t":87.7,"txt":"I didn't even think to mention that this could be"},{"t":89.7,"txt":"something kind of quirky."},{"t":95.9,"txt":"It never occurred to me that I would take over this"},{"t":98.5,"txt":"business. My background is actually in film."},{"t":101.4,"txt":"Tim has a very different background as well. He works"},{"t":103.2,"txt":"in crisis PR communications."},{"t":105.1,"txt":"I think that the plan was always to not keep it in the"},{"t":108.1,"txt":"family because I was never involved."},{"t":110.3,"txt":"So this was very much a surprise. It very much"},{"t":112.3,"txt":"dropped in our laps overnight."},{"t":120.5,"txt":"Being in the death care space,"},{"t":122.7,"txt":"one would think that you would have all your plans"},{"t":124.7,"txt":"put into place."},{"t":125.9,"txt":"But he was 68 years old, so I don't think,"},{"t":128.6,"txt":"even though he was ill, there weren't really big"},{"t":131.6,"txt":"plans in place."},{"t":132.6,"txt":"He didn't specify much."},{"t":134.1,"txt":"He did specify he wanted to be here."},{"t":136.3,"txt":"So that's what we did."},{"t":137.4,"txt":"And then he said, on my memorial,"},{"t":140.1,"txt":"I want to-- I want it to say,"},{"t":141.6,"txt":"\"Returned to sender\"."},{"t":142.7,"txt":"So I did that. And clearly he loved baseball."},{"t":151.7,"txt":"There was definitely something within me where I"},{"t":154.3,"txt":"always wanted to own something in life."},{"t":157.1,"txt":"I never knew what that was though."},{"t":159.5,"txt":"And we looked around and said, do you know what? This"},{"t":161.4,"txt":"business has been around a hundred years and has not"},{"t":163.9,"txt":"failed. So there is something to this business"},{"t":166.5,"txt":"that we could really make work and is obviously very,"},{"t":169.4,"txt":"very stable."},{"t":170.6,"txt":"I think it was Tim's enthusiasm and Tim's"},{"t":173.4,"txt":"doggedness in trying to understand this business and"},{"t":176.1,"txt":"trying to understand the space to unlock what the"},{"t":178.3,"txt":"potential really could be."},{"t":179.6,"txt":"And once I kind of saw the vision he had,"},{"t":182.4,"txt":"that's when I was like, oh, okay,"},{"t":183.9,"txt":"I get it. Very old purchase records."},{"t":187.5,"txt":"$50 sold in 1964."},{"t":190.1,"txt":"So we just have records of everything."},{"t":192.7,"txt":"When we came in day one, no one had emails."},{"t":195.8,"txt":"It's as if you're almost transported back into 1974."},{"t":198.9,"txt":"This is like a prized jewel because if we lose this map,"},{"t":202,"txt":"we're in trouble."},{"t":202.8,"txt":"I think in the first three weeks we were like,"},{"t":204.8,"txt":"guys, we need to like, move into the day and age in"},{"t":207.3,"txt":"which modern business practices exist."},{"t":209.8,"txt":"That would be great."},{"t":219.8,"txt":"So we make money selling four items."},{"t":222.7,"txt":"First item is a burial plot."},{"t":225.4,"txt":"We sell burial vaults, which is an outer burial"},{"t":228.8,"txt":"container that goes in the ground."},{"t":231,"txt":"We sell professional services,"},{"t":232.9,"txt":"which is otherwise known as opening and closing of a"},{"t":235.9,"txt":"gravesite, or opening a mausoleum,"},{"t":238.1,"txt":"crypt and then a memorial, or what others know as a"},{"t":241.7,"txt":"headstone."},{"t":255.2,"txt":"We're still putting in every single dollar of profit back"},{"t":257.9,"txt":"into this business."},{"t":259.2,"txt":"And our goal is very much almost thinking like a"},{"t":262,"txt":"nonprofit in values, where we want to reinvest"},{"t":264.2,"txt":"back into these spaces to improve them."},{"t":266.7,"txt":"And then as they become better businesses,"},{"t":268.9,"txt":"we can look to potentially taper off that profit and"},{"t":271.8,"txt":"return it back."},{"t":273,"txt":"If we could apply something similar."},{"t":274.8,"txt":"Yeah, I mean, similar-- similar would be"},{"t":276.5,"txt":"putting a building on it."},{"t":277.6,"txt":"The biggest expense of running the business is the"},{"t":280.4,"txt":"salaries. Followed by that is the spending that we do"},{"t":283.7,"txt":"on the grounds."},{"t":284.8,"txt":"Without him we would be nowhere."},{"t":287.3,"txt":"I think Dennis really runs the show here."},{"t":289.6,"txt":"That is a very, very large amount of money"},{"t":292.4,"txt":"that is invested every single year to make sure"},{"t":295.4,"txt":"that the grounds look perfect."},{"t":297.3,"txt":"That is what we're judged on."},{"t":298.8,"txt":"That is our number one brand asset."},{"t":301.2,"txt":"This one dates back to 1945."},{"t":303.7,"txt":"So that's when the war ended."},{"t":305.6,"txt":"We have rooms and rooms of file cabinets."},{"t":307.8,"txt":"There's hundreds of thousands of records because"},{"t":310.2,"txt":"there's hundreds of thousands of people that are"},{"t":311.8,"txt":"buried within our cemeteries."},{"t":313.4,"txt":"And then we also have something called death"},{"t":315.1,"txt":"cards, and that is rolodexes."},{"t":316.8,"txt":"The thing that you had in the 90s where you were like"},{"t":318.6,"txt":"looking up someone's phone number and it has the"},{"t":320.6,"txt":"person's name and where they are."},{"t":322.6,"txt":"One of the big projects was digitization."},{"t":324.8,"txt":"I mean, I thought it would be like six months and we're"},{"t":327,"txt":"good and we are two and a half years later and we're"},{"t":330,"txt":"barely halfway through."},{"t":342.9,"txt":"The idea is that it generates growth over time."},{"t":345.3,"txt":"That can obviously build a sustainable fund for this"},{"t":347.6,"txt":"cemetery once it's full."},{"t":349.1,"txt":"When you do reach a full capacity,"},{"t":351.9,"txt":"then you tap into that trust,"},{"t":353.6,"txt":"and that is basically to keep the grass mowed,"},{"t":356.6,"txt":"to keep the space not looking like it has"},{"t":360.4,"txt":"essentially suffered from neglect."},{"t":377.3,"txt":"Hollywood Cemetery is a non-perpetual care cemetery."},{"t":381.1,"txt":"It is abandoned and has been since I'd say the 1960s."},{"t":385.2,"txt":"It suffered essentially from white flight."},{"t":387.5,"txt":"There wasn't great investment in the"},{"t":389.1,"txt":"neighborhood and because there was no perpetual care"},{"t":391.6,"txt":"set up, slowly but surely, the entire space got run"},{"t":395.8,"txt":"over with essentially flora."},{"t":406.1,"txt":"Does everybody get garbage bags?"},{"t":409.2,"txt":"I just want to say a big thank you for you all being"},{"t":411.2,"txt":"here today. We've had many groups come out here over"},{"t":413.5,"txt":"the last few years that have helped try and turn"},{"t":416.3,"txt":"Hollywood back into what it should be,"},{"t":418.4,"txt":"a beautiful space for the community."},{"t":420.5,"txt":"And we just want to say thank you so much for being"},{"t":422.3,"txt":"here and being a part of that."},{"t":425.6,"txt":"All right."},{"t":429.5,"txt":"We're focused on growth."},{"t":430.8,"txt":"It may sound very weird hearing that in a cemetery"},{"t":434.1,"txt":"business, but growth is fundamental to our business."},{"t":437.5,"txt":"It enables us to pay our staff more."},{"t":439.5,"txt":"It enables us to hire more."},{"t":441.1,"txt":"It enables us to make our perpetual care funds even"},{"t":444.4,"txt":"stronger, which is one of our core missions in this"},{"t":446.9,"txt":"business. Growth is fundamental to everything we"},{"t":449.7,"txt":"do."},{"t":450.3,"txt":"Sometimes it is a very difficult space."},{"t":452.1,"txt":"Some days are harder than others,"},{"t":453.9,"txt":"but I'd say for the most part,"},{"t":456.2,"txt":"it's not a totally grief stricken space."},{"t":459.7,"txt":"We've been invited to picnics celebrating their"},{"t":461.8,"txt":"uncle's birthday. And so in honor of him,"},{"t":464.7,"txt":"you know, they've brought a picnic with his favorite"},{"t":466.7,"txt":"foods. It feels like communing more than"},{"t":469.2,"txt":"grieving. I feel like that is really what the space is"},{"t":472.5,"txt":"for."}],"words":[{"t":0.64,"w":"We"},